NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT license covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only. The datasets
and model checkpoints released alongside this work are licensed separately:

  - DistractMath-BN benchmark (dipta007/DistractMath-Bn): CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  - Training data (dipta007/dagger):                      CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  - Model checkpoints (dipta007/dagger-*):                Gemma Terms of Use
                                             https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

Upstream source datasets retain their own licenses: MGSM (CC BY 4.0),
MSVAMP (Apache-2.0), SVAMP (MIT), GSM8K (MIT), SOMADHAN (CC BY 4.0),
NuminaMath-CoT (Apache-2.0), and numina-math-cot-bn (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

Note that numina-math-cot-bn is NON-COMMERCIAL (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and was used
for supervised fine-tuning and GRPO prompts. Users intending commercial use
should re-derive the training data from the Apache-2.0 upstream
AI-MO/NuminaMath-CoT instead.
